  "bounds": [
    "Fresh rehash and root selected passage read for all11 original assets. No acquisition or prior PASS transfer; original XML body used for purchased quality report.",
    "CJC healthy-subject subcutaneous analogue, circulating drug versus GH/IGFI distinct, clinical utility and longer-term efficacy/safety still future. No injection product/dosing/tendon-benefit inference.",
    "BPC parent LC-MS/MS animal plasma curves distinct from radioactivity, metabolites and unmeasured target-tissue identity. No human dosing or efficacy inference.",
    "Rat fibroblast receptor RNA/protein, MTT viable-cell readout, PCNA and JAK2 phosphorylation distinct. Figure3 physical5; matrix background not added repair endpoint. Cultured-cell limits explicit.",
    "Rat repaired-tendon specimens allocated separately for histology and mechanics; pathologist/coded specimens masked, surgery/treatment unmasked. Histology/IHC semiquantitative distinct from tensile load. No causal human benefit added.",
    "Eye source physical13 rendered to resolve duplicate extraction and confirm database lock/unmask timeline. Primary/sensitivity/alternative distinct, early termination/baseline/sample limits and subjective discomfort preserved. No masking-completeness certification or ophthalmic-to-injection extrapolation.",
    "Collagen controlled acute healthy adult crossover plasma AAs, product-specific differential uptake not clinical joint repair. STEP selected observational extension after both medication/lifestyle ceased.",
    "GIP dual tirzepatide stored fasting posthoc biomarker analysis, excludes post-discontinuation/rescue data. Enzyme mass not activity; kinetic/CV benefit not established by this paper.",
    "Quality identity/content/purity separate from microbial/endotoxin tests, small received online sample and high-price exclusion; manufacturing specified antiviral miniprotein not consumer product validation.",
    "Only source-fidelity of qualitative additions, not complete scientific appraisal, human approval, numerical calibration, new grade or release. Application diff/regression/mobile/seal pending."
  ],
